<title>USA: TABLE--Cousins Properties Q2 FFO shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE--Cousins Properties Q2 FFO shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> FFO shr		    $0.48		    $0.40</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.26		     0.28</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.26		     0.30</p>
<p> Net			  7,455		    8,549</p>
<p> Revs			21,141		   14,155</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,189		   28,405</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> FFO shr		    $0.92		    $0.77</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.51		     0.54</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.59		     0.56</p>
<p> Net			 17,079		   15,847</p>
<p> Revs			41,432		   27,378</p>
<p> Avg			 29,093		   28,342</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The second-quarter 1996 net earnings include a $0.02 gain a share from selling properties.</p>
<p>The six-month net earnings include gains of $0.02 a share in 1996 and $0.08 a share in 1997.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Cousins Properties Inc.</p>
